{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Truck Up: Catch Me If You Can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a post-apocalyptic world with <strong>Truck Up</strong>! Defend your towns from hordes of zombies with weapon-equipped vehicles, or control the undead army and unleash chaos upon cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two teams, two distinct strategies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defenders:</strong> Fight to protect the town using vehicles, drones, and heavy weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attackers:</strong> Take control of the zombies and transport deadly hordes into the city using buses, trucks, and drones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Intense battles of strategy and chaos between two teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-Player Mode:</strong> Stand your ground against waves of zombies in a defense war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong> Play offline with two players controlling two vehicles together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Realistic physics-based vehicle combat.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Destructible vehicles and unique weapon combinations.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>2 maps and 14 distinct vehicles offering diverse gameplay.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Controllable zombies, drones, and more!</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s Coming Next?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expanding the number of maps: Mountains, deserts, islands, beaches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding new vehicles and weapon types: Customize vehicles with unique weapon options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing new controllable devices: Mini remote-controlled vehicles alongside drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing zombie variety: New zombie species, including infected humans and animals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you defend the towns, or lead the zombie hordes to destruction? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add Truck Up to your Steam Wishlist and join the action today!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411890?t=1744288211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411890?t=1744288211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411890/60c3276e80b036f0a4af5bdc214a43b2ab87f7a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744288211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411890/60c3276e80b036f0a4af5bdc214a43b2ab87f7a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744288211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood, violent acts, accidental death, injury, corpse, definition of violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3554120,"description":